      "summary": "The exact one-file diff was reviewed against issue #384 and the trusted repository policy. The workflow implements the requested ref checks, bounded App token, exact dev-tree commit, two parents, and isolated reconciliation ref, but it adds several runtime and policy branches without the required automated coverage.",
