          "details": "Repository policy requires tests under tests/ for every changed runtime or policy branch, but this PR adds only the workflow. The bespoke logic—including protected-main enforcement, exact dev/main checks, existing-ref refusal, exact tree and parent construction, and isolated branch publication—is therefore not covered. The claimed policy checker and trigger-policy results do not demonstrate these GitHub-script behaviors. Add focused tests that inspect or exercise these branches and prove the acceptance-critical commit and ref arguments.",
